#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:100
msgid ""
"立方晶相（413 K）の平均構造。格子定数は :math:`a=b=c=4.0097` Å。 "
"Quloudのモデラーに実験構造を読み込み、表示した。色はBa（緑）、Ti（灰色）、 O（赤）を示す。表示には隣接する周期像も含まれる。"
msgstr ""
"Average structure of the cubic phase (413 K), with lattice constant "
":math:`a=b=c=4.0097` Å. The experimental structure was loaded into and "
"displayed in the Quloud modeler. The colors indicate Ba (green), Ti "
"(gray), and O (red). The display also includes neighboring periodic "
"images."

#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:104
msgid "Quloudで表示したBaTiO3正方晶相の単位胞"
msgstr "Unit cell of tetragonal BaTiO3 displayed in Quloud"

#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:110
msgid ""
"正方晶相（303 K）。格子定数は :math:`a=b=3.9925` Å、:math:`c=4.0371` Å。 Tiと酸素の相対変位、および"
" :math:`c>a` の格子ひずみが見られる。"
msgstr ""
"Tetragonal phase (303 K), with lattice constants :math:`a=b=3.9925` Å and"
" :math:`c=4.0371` Å. The figure shows the relative displacement of Ti and"
" oxygen, and the lattice strain :math:`c>a`."

#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:113
msgid ""
"図の座標はNakataniらの単結晶X線回折による実験構造に基づく。2つの温度の構造を "
"並べているため、図は相転移をその場で追跡したものではない。また、高温立方晶相 "
"では局所的なTi変位が残りうることが報告されており、立方晶の図は平均構造を表す [Nakatani2016]_。"
msgstr ""
"The coordinates in the figures come from experimental structures measured"
" by Nakatani and coauthors using single-crystal X-ray diffraction. The "
"figures compare structures at two temperatures and therefore do not track"
" the phase transition in situ. Although local Ti displacements have been "
"reported to persist in the high-temperature cubic phase, the cubic view "
"shows the average structure [Nakatani2016]_."

