#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:138
msgid ""
"正方晶相の格子ひずみは、格子定数を使って :math:`c/a` で表せる。立方晶からの ずれは :math:`c/a-1` "
"で見積もれる。ただし、この比だけでは分極の大きさは 求まらない。分極には単位胞内の各原子の変位と電子状態も関係する（\\ :ref:`分極の評価"
"<polarization-evaluation>`）。"
msgstr ""
"The tetragonal lattice strain can be expressed by the ratio :math:`c/a` "
"of the lattice constants. Estimate the deviation from cubic symmetry by "
":math:`c/a-1`. This ratio alone, however, cannot give the magnitude of "
"the polarization. The displacement of each atom in the unit cell and the "
"electronic state also contribute (see \\ :ref:`evaluation of polarization"
" <polarization-evaluation>`)."

#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:146
msgid "4つの相と分極の向き"
msgstr "Four Phases and Their Polarization Directions"

#: ../../solid/ferroelectricity.rst:148
msgid ""
"正方晶相をさらに冷やすと、BaTiO\\ :sub:`3`\\ は約278 Kで直方晶（斜方晶ともいう）相へ、約183 Kで菱面体晶相へ移る "
"[Kwei1993]_ [Shi2018]_。以下では、立方晶・正方晶・直方晶・菱面体晶の相をそれぞれC・T・O・Rと書く。Merzは、 "
"低温側の二つの転移で分極の向きが変わることを測定し、これを、酸素八面体の中でTiの変位の向きが :math:`[001]` から "
":math:`[011]` へ、 さらに :math:`[111]` へ変わることと対応づけた [Merz1949]_。方向は、どの相でも\\ "
":ref:`擬立方胞<pseudocubic-cell>`\\ の軸で書く（各相の胞と擬立方胞の関係は :numref:`lt-batio3"
"-pseudocubic-table`）。 :numref:`tbl-batio3-four-phases` と :numref:`fig-"
"batio3-polar-directions` に4相をまとめる。"
msgstr ""
"On cooling the tetragonal phase further, BaTiO\\ :sub:`3` \\ changes to "
"the orthorhombic phase at about 278 K and to the rhombohedral phase at "
"about 183 K [Kwei1993]_ [Shi2018]_. Here we use C, T, O, and R for the "
"cubic, tetragonal, orthorhombic, and rhombohedral phases, respectively. "
"Merz measured changes in the polarization direction at the two lower-"
"temperature transitions and related them to successive changes in the "
"direction of Ti displacement within the oxygen octahedron from "
":math:`[001]` to :math:`[011]` and then to :math:`[111]` [Merz1949]_. "
"Directions in every phase are given in the axes of the \\ "
":ref:`pseudocubic cell <pseudocubic-cell>` \\ (see :numref:`lt-batio3"
"-pseudocubic-table` for its relation to the cell of each phase). :numref"
":`tbl-batio3-four-phases` and :numref:`fig-batio3-polar-directions` "
"summarize the four phases."

